sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant NET as MSK .NET 8
    participant CIP as Azure integrationsplatformen
    participant PD as Persondatabasen, IDM
    participant EDRMS as EDRMS / WorkZone
    participant ORG as Organisationsregisteret
    participant SMTP as Mailservice

    NET->>CIP: hentPersonUdfraAUID / hentPersonByCpr
    CIP->>PD: GET PATCH POST persons
    PD-->>CIP: Person-data
    CIP-->>NET: AUPerson

    NET->>CIP: hentFuzzyMatch
    CIP->>PD: get-fuzzy-matches
    PD-->>NET: Matching AUID'er

    NET->>CIP: hentArbejdsrelationerUdfraAUID
    CIP-->>NET: Arbejdsrelationer

    NET->>CIP: OpretSag (asynkron)
    CIP->>EDRMS: POST cases
    EDRMS-->>NET: caseUrl + sag

    NET->>CIP: HentSagsgruppe / gemPartUdfraAUID
    CIP->>EDRMS: case-groups / cases med PartyAssociationCreate
    EDRMS-->>NET: Sagsgruppe + sag

    NET->>CIP: Opslagsdata: enheder, stillingstyper, titler, landekoder
    CIP->>ORG: organisational-units, job-types, Countries
    ORG-->>NET: Referencelister

    NET->>CIP: afsendVelkomstmail
    CIP->>SMTP: send-email-notifikation
    SMTP-->>NET: Ok
